{"4983370": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "FROG IN THE HOLE!", "steam_appid": 4983370, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "dlc": [5091980], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn a $1,000,000,000 payout by sacrificing frogs to the hole. In this incremental sandbox, you'll <strong>build</strong> physics-based factories, to <strong>scale</strong> from manual tossing to <strong>managing</strong> a chaotic swarm. <strong>Sweep</strong>, <strong>magnetize</strong>, <strong>master</strong> the skill tree and <strong>chain</strong> combos. What happens to the sacrifices? <i>BECOME WORTHY.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EARN EARN EARN EARN EARN!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breed frogs and offer them to the hole to EARN MONEY.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983370/extras/93a1af87f0507a37b39c49db5a3dac1a.poster.avif?t=1786807049\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983370/extras/93a1af87f0507a37b39c49db5a3dac1a.webm?t=1786807049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983370/extras/93a1af87f0507a37b39c49db5a3dac1a.mp4?t=1786807049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUY ITEMS &amp; UPGRADES!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experiment with unique items, master the skill tree, and chain combos to reap the highest REWARDS!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983370/extras/6ac47c7756b578581bb849dc08290237.poster.avif?t=1786807049\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983370/extras/6ac47c7756b578581bb849dc08290237.webm?t=1786807049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983370/extras/6ac47c7756b578581bb849dc08290237.mp4?t=1786807049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BUILD BUILD BUILD BUILD BUILD!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Construct massive physics-based factories deep underground, tweak your creative designs and keep the chaos under control! Efficiently, of course.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983370/extras/09defa34b4066a8dcfea1a75ea3c269c.poster.avif?t=1786807049\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983370/extras/09defa34b4066a8dcfea1a75ea3c269c.webm?t=1786807049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983370/extras/09defa34b4066a8dcfea1a75ea3c269c.mp4?t=1786807049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPLORE THE CULT.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover mysterious secrets, rescue friends and find out what happens when you finally satisfy <i>The Old One</i>.<br><strong>Can you make $1,000,000,000 to escape the underground?</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983370/extras/642938e5ed9c0f25fba96ba644f65f72.poster.avif?t=1786807049\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983370/extras/642938e5ed9c0f25fba96ba644f65f72.webm?t=1786807049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983370/extras/642938e5ed9c0f25fba96ba644f65f72.mp4?t=1786807049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Additional Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Addictive gameplay with escalating audio effects</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the hidden developer console for maximum sandbox fun! (Press [F5])</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full controller support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a handcrafted PSX-style environment</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wishlist now or Mr. Frog will be sad</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983370/extras/f23507a32f4957577a9e723dbfdd2d45.poster.avif?t=1786807049\" width=1170 height=512 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983370/extras/f23507a32f4957577a9e723dbfdd2d45.webm?t=1786807049\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4983370/extras/f23507a32f4957577a9e723dbfdd2d45.mp4?t=1786807049\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earn a $1,000,000,000 payout by sacrificing frogs to the hole. In this incremental sandbox, you'll <strong>build</strong> physics-based factories, to <strong>scale</strong> from manual tossing to <strong>managing</strong> a chaotic swarm. <strong>Sweep</strong>, <strong>magnetize</strong>, <strong>master</strong> the skill tree and <strong>chain</strong> combos. What happens to the sacrifices? <i>BECOME WORTHY.</i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EARN EARN EARN EARN EARN!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Breed frogs and offer them to the hole to EARN MONEY.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster